      "content": "These are a good start for the \"innovation\" part, but honestly, I'm not seeing much of the other stuff we talked about. The questions feel a bit generic.\n\nCould you try to refine these? I really want to make sure we're hitting all those specific pillars—especially things like synergy and the growth-mindset aspect. Try to weave those themes into the questions more clearly so the interviewers know exactly what they are looking for. \n\nAgain, please don't make them sound robotic or just list the words, I just want the themes to be much more obvious and present in each question so my dashboard shows a way higher score. Just make them \"better\" versions of what you just sent.",
